{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-73","level":"B1","kind":"fill","title":{"de":"Jung und Alt 2","bn":"নবীন ও প্রবীণ ২"},"questions":[{"type":"gap","prompt":"Meine Großmutter wohnt in einem ___. (কেয়ার হোম)","answers":["Pflegeheim"],"options":["Pflegeheim","Wohnprojekt","Notizbuch"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-73-q1"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Mein Opa hört schlecht. Er braucht ein ___. (শ্রবণ সহায়ক যন্ত্র)","answers":["Hörgerät"],"options":["Hörgerät","Notizbuch","Gedächtnis"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-73-q2"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich wohne mit drei Studenten in einer ___. (শেয়ার্ড অ্যাপার্টমেন্ট)","answers":["Wohngemeinschaft"],"options":["Wohngemeinschaft","Kinderbetreuung","Teilnahme"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-73-q3"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Im ___ wohnen Jung und Alt zusammen. (বহু প্রজন্মের বাড়ি)","answers":["Mehrgenerationenhaus"],"options":["Mehrgenerationenhaus","Altersheim","Wohnprojekt"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-73-q4"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Mein Opa hat ein sehr gutes ___. Er weiß noch alles. (স্মৃতি)","answers":["Gedächtnis"],"options":["Gedächtnis","Vertrauen","Verhältnis"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-73-q5"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Das ___ zwischen mir und meinen Eltern ist gut. (সম্পর্ক)","answers":["Verhältnis"],"options":["Verhältnis","Gedächtnis","Alter"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-73-q6"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ohne ___ geht es nicht. (বিশ্বাস)","answers":["Vertrauen"],"options":["Vertrauen","Zusammensein","Heimweh"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-73-q7"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Das ältere ___ wohnt seit 50 Jahren hier. (বিবাহিত দম্পতি)","answers":["Ehepaar"],"options":["Ehepaar","Pflegeheim","Hörgerät"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-73-q8"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Er ___ den Chef gesehe